-- Real menu for Los Taquitos de PM, transcribed from the live site's
-- Fco. de Montejo branch menu (https://www.lostaquitosdepm.com/menufranciscodemontejo,
-- scraped + read via vision on 2026-09-02). Replaces/extends whatever placeholder
-- categories/products existed so the site and the voice agent quote real prices.
--
-- NOTE: if the products table already has placeholder/admin-entered rows, this
-- migration ADDS to them rather than replacing them (no unique constraint on
-- products.name to safely upsert on). Review/clean up duplicates after applying,
-- or truncate `products` first if you want a clean slate.

ON CONFLICT (restaurant_id, slug) DO UPDATE
SET name = EXCLUDED.name, display_order = EXCLUDED.display_order;

